    Add Test-Json cmdlet (NJsonSchema) (#5229)
    
    Resolve #4220.
    
    The cmdlet is based on NJsonSchema.
    It allows to check:
    
    JSON by only parsing
    JSON against Schema
    implicitly check Schema by parsing (based on previous line check)
